; Bench-Max - Quake III's demo 'four' as a timedemo at 1600x1200 with the
; highest graphics settings (max.cfg): the gl4es build on ogles2.library,
; then the MiniGL build of the installed game (its own quake3), the same
; settings.
;   CD to the ogles2-m6-2 directory, then:   Execute Bench-Max
;   With the game elsewhere:   Execute Bench-Max Q3DATA=<the directory with baseq3>
; Output goes to results/max-*. Each game's own files go to home-max/ here
; (gl4es) and RAM:q3mgl-max (MiniGL); max.cfg is their autoexec.cfg.
.key Q3DATA/K
.def Q3DATA "Stuff:Quake3-68k-beta10/Quake3-68k-beta10"
.bra {
.ket }

FailAt 21
If NOT EXISTS libs/ogles2.library
  Echo "Please CD into the ogles2-m6-2 directory first,"
  Echo "then run:  Execute Bench-Max"
  Quit 20
EndIf

Assign M6R2: ""
If NOT EXISTS M6R2:results
  MakeDir M6R2:results
EndIf
If NOT EXISTS M6R2:cache
  MakeDir M6R2:cache
EndIf
If NOT EXISTS M6R2:home-max/baseq3
  MakeDir M6R2:home-max M6R2:home-max/baseq3
EndIf
If NOT EXISTS RAM:q3mgl-max/baseq3
  MakeDir RAM:q3mgl-max RAM:q3mgl-max/baseq3
EndIf
Copy M6R2:max.cfg M6R2:home-max/baseq3/autoexec.cfg QUIET
Copy M6R2:max.cfg RAM:q3mgl-max/baseq3/autoexec.cfg QUIET

Echo "Quake III, demo 'four' at 1600x1200, highest settings: gl4es on ogles2."
Echo "  The screen may stay black while the textures load."
Assign LIBS: M6R2:libs ADD
Assign OGLES2Cache: M6R2:cache
CD M6R2:bin
M6R2:bin/quake3-gl4es +set fs_basepath "{Q3DATA}" +set fs_homepath M6R2:home-max +set logfile 2 +set nextdemo quit +timedemo 1 +demo four >M6R2:results/max-gl4es.txt
Assign OGLES2Cache:
Assign LIBS: M6R2:libs REMOVE
Copy M6R2:home-max/baseq3/qconsole.log M6R2:results/max-gl4es-console.log QUIET

Echo "The same on MiniGL (the installed quake3)."
Wait 2
CD "{Q3DATA}"
quake3 +set fs_basepath "{Q3DATA}" +set fs_homepath RAM:q3mgl-max +set logfile 2 +set nextdemo quit +timedemo 1 +demo four >M6R2:results/max-minigl.txt
Copy RAM:q3mgl-max/baseq3/qconsole.log M6R2:results/max-minigl-console.log QUIET

CD M6R2:
Assign M6R2:
Echo "Done. Results are in results/max-*."
